Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get along well from now on, Leria-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Likewise, Neil-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be you've fallen for my brother's beauty? \NYou actually have a cute side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for getting along with Nia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah no, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn't you just say \Nyou two weren't getting along?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! \NLet's start getting along from now on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the person Leria wants to get along with not me, \Nbut my brother instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You and Neil-sama—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get along with both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that, but I'm sorry for \Nsuddenly intruding on the Silver Dorm's filming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all. Nia told me Neil-sama doesn't like \Nappearing in Magic Visions much. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you still joined the shoot—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you tell me to "{\i1}go call your brother{\i0}"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not say unnecessary things!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just get along. \NGet along...HIHIHIHI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. \NLet's get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful that my little sister has made such a nice friend. \NI'm so glad!
